      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "求极值及其类型",
          "steps": [
            "$\\frac{\\partial g}{\\partial x} = 2x - 2 = 0 \\Rightarrow x = 1$",
            "$\\frac{\\partial g}{\\partial y} = 2y - 4 = 0 \\Rightarrow y = 2$",
            "驻点：$(1, 2)$",
            "$g_{xx} = 2$，$g_{yy} = 2$，$g_{xy} = 0$",
            "$\\Delta = 2 \\cdot 2 - 0 = 4 > 0$，且 $g_{xx} = 2 > 0$",
            "$(1,2)$ 是极小值点，极小值为 $g(1,2) = 1 + 4 - 2 - 8 + 5 = 0$"
          ]
        }
