            "$h_{xx} = 6$，$h_{yy} = 6$，$h_{xy} = -3$",
            "$\\Delta = 36 - 9 = 27 > 0$，$h_{xx} = 6 > 0$ ⟹ 极小值",
            "极小值：$h(1,1) = 1 + 1 - 3 = -1$"
